      "body": "Citrus Castings Private Limited, Nirmal Kedia and Nitin Kedia proposed to acquire remaining 28.61% stake in Nitin Castings Limited (BSE:508875) from public shareholders on January 30, 2026.\r\n\r\nThe transaction is subject to approval from stock exchange, approval of merger agreement by Nitin Castings Limited board and shareholders and receipt of sufficient valid tenders of Equity Shares. Meeting of board of directors will be held on February 4, 2026, to approve the acquisition.\r\n\r\nNavigant Corporate Advisors Limited acted as manager to Citrus Castings Private Limited, Nirmal Kedia and Nitin Kedia.",
